Package: rprobitfast
Title: Exact Multinomial Probit Where MACML Approximates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Cotton", email = "peter.cotton@microprediction.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Multinomial probit estimation with an exact
    factor-conditional likelihood and analytic score, aimed at the model
    class served by the 'Rprobit' package (Bauer), whose MACML engine rests
    on Mendell-Elston / Solow-Joe analytic approximations. Those
    approximations are fast and centrally accurate but drift silently in
    the tails (measured: tail probabilities off by a factor of ~4 at
    n=30 with nothing in the output announcing it); this package prices
    the same likelihoods exactly, to quadrature accuracy, with a
    sharpness-escalating node rule and referee-evaluated reporting.
